1. Minimum workflow end-to-end (L7): create project → import without silently rewriting originals → inspect metadata/provenance → navigate/adjust display → annotate → save → close → reopen on another machine → export annotation table or overlay + small derived image → verify what transformed vs. remained unchanged.
